{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117330","id":3385041891,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7Jw6Pj","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117330","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117330.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117330.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117330","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117330/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117330/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117330/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ab0a022b92792702346deadff074c2e538ff600d","number":117330,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[4.6] Add editor option to toggle idle parsing","user":{"login":"Cre8or","id":3143797,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNDM3OTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3143797?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cre8or","html_url":"https://github.com/Cre8or","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cre8or/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cre8or/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cre8or/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cre8or/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cre8or/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cre8or/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cre8or/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cre8or/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cre8or/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This is a port of my PR #105590 for Godot 4.6. I am making a new PR because it has nearly been a full year since I submitted the previous PR for Godot 4.4, and I figured merging my changes directly into the 4.6 branch would be a better idea.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Quick recap:\r\n\r\nThis PR adds an editor option to enable (or disable) idle parsing. When disabled, the script editor will no longer perform any idle parsing. It will, however, continue to parse scripts:\r\n- when they are saved, or\r\n- when another script is opened (e.g. by switching through scripts in the script editor).\r\n\r\nThat first point is worth elaborating on. In upstream 4.6, scripts are not parsed in the script editor upon saving. Instead, you have to wait for the idle parsing timer to complete in order to have your scripts validated/checked for errors. While I didn't aim to address this directly, my idle parse toggling implementation _required_ me to enable parsing on file save, as parsing would otherwise not occur at all. This is good because it has the side effect of making the script editor more intuitive to use, which is a welcome bonus as far as I'm concerned. :stuck_out_tongue: ","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","description":"","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archiv